"""Remote control for the cezanne's IR blaster (/dev/lirc0): TVs by brand and
air conditioners, with codes from IRext (https://github.com/irext, MIT).

TV codes are stored decoded in the database (build-db.py); an AC code depends
on the whole state (power, mode, temperature, fan, swing), so it comes from
IRext's decoder library (libirdecode.so) and the remote's protocol binary.
IR is one-way: the AC state shown is the one last sent.
"""
